Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.91,0:03:38.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦  我还真想吃点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.53,0:03:48.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, it seems pretty simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.53,0:03:48.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的  这看起来很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:50.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your first line is, "My name is Claude."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:50.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的第一句台词是 "我的名字叫克劳德"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.87,0:03:52.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So just repeat after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.87,0:03:52.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好  跟我念
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:03.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Well, let's try it again. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:03.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-呃  我们再试一遍  -好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.24,0:04:11.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.24,0:04:11.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟我说的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...quite what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:14.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不太一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:17.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Sounds exactly the same to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:17.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的  我听着一模一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:20.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- It does, really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:20.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是吗  真的  -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.29,0:04:22.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Let's just try it again. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.29,0:04:22.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们再试一遍  -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:24.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Really listen. - Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:24.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-仔细听着  -好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.91,0:04:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, you guys! - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.91,0:04:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿  伙计们   -嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.45,0:04:41.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want you to meet someone really special.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.45,0:04:41.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给你们介绍一个很特别的贵宾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.24,0:04:45.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe, this is Erica. And this is the baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.24,0:04:45.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  这是艾瑞卡  这是小宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:48.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Joey, Erica, baby. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:48.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-乔伊  艾瑞卡  宝宝   -嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:51.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everyone, Erica! Baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:51.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家伙儿  艾瑞卡  宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.05,0:04:53.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica. Calm. Self.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.05,0:04:53.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡  冷静...点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.74,0:04:56.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, sit down. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.74,0:04:56.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-请坐  -谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:04:58.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's really nice to meet you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:04:58.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真高兴见到你们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.26,0:04:59.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.26,0:04:59.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我都不敢相信来到这儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.79,0:05:02.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, welcome to New York City, or should I say:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.79,0:05:02.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欢迎来到纽约  或者我应该说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.30,0:05:04.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知所云的法语
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.47,0:05:07.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.47,0:05:07.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你干吗要说那个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.39,0:05:11.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. What are you gonna be doing today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.39,0:05:11.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们今天打算干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.59,0:05:13.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I wanna see everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.59,0:05:13.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦  我想看看所有的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:16.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Times Square, Coney lsland, Rockefeller Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:16.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}时代广场  科尼岛  洛克菲勒中心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.59,0:05:17.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you know what you should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.59,0:05:17.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦  你知道你该干什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:18.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You should walk to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:18.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该一路爬到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.67,0:05:19.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the top of the Statue of Liberty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.67,0:05:19.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}自由女神像的顶上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.95,0:05:22.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, yeah, let's do that. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.95,0:05:22.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-哦  对呀  我们去爬吧   -太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.14,0:05:25.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This baby better be really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.14,0:05:25.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个小宝宝得够结实才行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.03,0:05:32.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. Excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.03,0:05:32.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨  打扰一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.49,0:05:33.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm here to see my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.49,0:05:33.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我来看望我的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.41,0:05:34.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My name is Rachel Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.41,0:05:34.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我叫瑞秋·格林
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.33,0:05:35.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'm Dr. Ross Geller.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.33,0:05:35.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是罗斯·盖勒博士
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.72,0:05:37.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, please, this is a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.72,0:05:37.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  行了吧  这里是医院
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.75,0:05:39.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That actually means something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.75,0:05:39.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这词儿在这儿是有其他意义的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.45,0:05:42.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So can we please go in? - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.45,0:05:42.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那么  我们能进去吗   -当然
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.64,0:05:44.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rach, I think I'm gonna wait out here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.64,0:05:44.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋  我想我还是等在外面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.89,0:05:47.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because my throat is feeling a little scratchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.89,0:05:47.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的喉咙有点痒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:48.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't wanna infect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:48.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想传染给他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:50.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, please. Don't be so scared of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:50.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  得了  别那么怕他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.85,0:05:53.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am not scared of him. I'm really sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.85,0:05:53.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是怕他  我真的病了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.48,0:05:54.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's under sedation,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.48,0:05:54.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}镇静剂药效还没退
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.47,0:05:55.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so he's pretty much out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.47,0:05:55.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以他还在昏睡着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.56,0:05:56.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.56,0:05:56.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我感觉好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.35,0:06:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.35,0:06:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:06.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That ear and nose hair trimmer I got him
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:06.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我给他买的耳毛和鼻毛剪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.04,0:06:08.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}was just money down the drain, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.04,0:06:08.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}算是白花钱了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.35,0:06:11.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ms. Green?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.35,0:06:11.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}格林小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.63,0:06:13.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your father's doctor's on the phone
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.63,0:06:13.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你爸爸的医生在电话上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.13,0:06:14.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}if you'd like to speak to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.13,0:06:14.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要不要跟他谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.23,0:06:15.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, great. Are you gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.23,0:06:15.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦  好的  呃  你在这等着没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.93,0:06:18.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's unconscious. We'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.93,0:06:18.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他还不省人事  我想我们没事儿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.08,0:06:18.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.08,0:06:18.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:59.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Did the TV wake you? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:59.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是不是电视吧你吵醒了   -不是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.61,0:07:01.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When you put your feet up on my bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.61,0:07:01.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你把脚翘到我床上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.82,0:07:03.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you tugged on my catheter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.82,0:07:03.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}压住我的导尿管了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.86,0:07:12.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing here, Geller?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.86,0:07:12.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你来这儿干吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.65,0:07:13.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I came with Rachel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.65,0:07:13.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我和瑞秋一块儿来的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.90,0:07:15.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}who should be back any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.90,0:07:15.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她一会儿就回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:18.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what's new?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:18.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最近怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.34,0:07:20.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I had a little heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.34,0:07:20.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦  我得了点儿心脏病
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.25,0:07:22.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right. Is it painful?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.25,0:07:22.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吧  疼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.09,0:07:24.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What, the heart attack
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.09,0:07:24.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  你是指心脏病
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:25.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}or sitting here talking to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:25.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是指在这跟你聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.49,0:07:30.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's see if we can get that Rachel back in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.49,0:07:30.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看能不能把瑞秋叫过来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.75,0:07:32.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what's new with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.75,0:07:32.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你最近怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.50,0:07:34.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Knocked up any more of my daughters lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.50,0:07:34.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是不是又让我别的女儿也怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:36.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nope. Just the one. Rach!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:36.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有  只有那一个  瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.35,0:07:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.35,0:07:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:48.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, maybe if we just break it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:48.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  也许我们应该拆散了试试
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.56,0:07:51.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, let's try it one syllable at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.56,0:07:51.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我们试试一次一个音节
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.53,0:07:53.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so repeat after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.53,0:07:53.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的  跟我念
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.68,0:07:59.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great! Okay, faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.68,0:07:59.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好  快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.07,0:08:09.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, it's too hard. I can't teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.07,0:08:09.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  这太难了  我教不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.47,0:08:10.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.47,0:08:10.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你干吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.14,0:08:11.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to go
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.14,0:08:11.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:12.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}before I put your head through a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:12.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不然我要拿你的头撞墙了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:15.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't go, I need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  别走  我需要你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.09,0:08:16.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My audition is tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.09,0:08:16.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我明天就要试镜了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.41,0:08:35.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey. I was gonna make us some dinner...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.41,0:08:35.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿  我本来想做晚饭的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.02,0:08:37.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but all I found in your dad's fridge
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.02,0:08:37.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是你爸的冰箱里
