Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:17.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just so weird seeing him like that, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:17.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看到他那个样子很奇怪  你知道吗
