Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:46.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们明天一早就去看他  好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.68,0:09:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? I shouldn't feel guilty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.68,0:09:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的  我不去也不用于心有愧
